{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1659","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Red Versus Blue"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Team Red and Team Blue competed in a competitive FPS. Their match was streamed around the world. They played a series of $$$n$$$ matches."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the end, it turned out Team Red won $$$r$$$ times and Team Blue won $$$b$$$ times. Team Blue was less skilled than Team Red, so $$$b$$$ was "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"strictly less"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" than $$$r$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You missed the stream since you overslept, but you think that the match must have been neck and neck since so many people watched it. So you imagine a string of length $$$n$$$ where the $$$i$$$-th character denotes who won the $$$i$$$-th match  — it is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"R"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if Team Red won or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if Team Blue won. You imagine the string was such that the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"maximum"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" number of times a team "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"won in a row"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" was "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"as small as possible"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". For example, in the series of matches "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"RBBRRRB"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", Team Red won $$$3$$$ times in a row, which is the maximum."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You must find a string satisfying the above conditions. If there are multiple answers, print any."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 1000$$$)  — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test case has a single line containing three integers $$$n$$$, $$$r$$$, and $$$b$$$ ($$$3 \\leq n \\leq 100$$$; $$$1 \\leq b \\lt r \\leq n$$$, $$$r+b=n$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output a single line containing a string satisfying the given conditions. If there are multiple answers, print any."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n7 4 3\n6 5 1\n19 13 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nRBRBRBR\nRRRBRR\nRRBRRBRRBRRBRRBRRBR\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n3 2 1\n10 6 4\n11 6 5\n10 9 1\n10 8 2\n11 9 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nRBR\nRRBRBRBRBR\nRBRBRBRBRBR\nRRRRRBRRRR\nRRRBRRRBRR\nRRRBRRRBRRR\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first test case of the first example gives the optimal answer for the example in the statement. The maximum number of times a team wins in a row in "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"RBRBRBR"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is $$$1$$$. We cannot minimize it any further."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The answer for the second test case of the second example is "},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"RR"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"BRBRBRBR"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". The maximum number of times a team wins in a row is $$$2$$$, given by "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"RR"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" at the beginning. We cannot minimize the answer any further."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1659A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1659/problem/A"}